{"id": "f2a908f3-759b-4043-b6d6-fc77a70afa16", "slug": "vertex-scalable-systems-for-tomorrow-1", "title": "Vertex - Scalable Systems For Tomorrow", "description": "Vertex Scalable Hero Section is designed for introducing a product with clear above-the-fold messaging. Key features include headline hierarchy, supporting copy, and a primary call-to-action. It is suitable for homepage hero areas and campaign landing pages.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Vertex - Scalable Systems For Tomorrow\"\ndescription: \"Vertex Scalable Hero Section is designed for introducing a product with clear above-the-fold messaging. Key features include headline hierarchy, supporting copy, and a primary call-to-action. It is suitable for homepage hero areas and campaign landing pages.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#4ADE80\"\n  secondary: \"#000000\"\n  accent: \"#10B981\"\n  background: \"#010A04\"\n  surface: \"#191C21\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#D4D4D4\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Pixelify Sans\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Vertex - Scalable Systems For Tomorrow\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 126; favorites: 8; remixes: 3.\nTags: hero, section, animated, webgl, threejs, cta, dither, effect.\n## Overview\nVertex Scalable Hero Section is designed for introducing a product with clear above-the-fold messaging. Key features include headline hierarchy, supporting copy, and a primary call-to-action. It is suitable for homepage hero areas and campaign landing pages.\n\nVertex Solutions Framework Company Reach Out Activate Core Built for resilience. Tuned for performance. Systems That Scale On Command. We construct robust, distributed architectures and dynamic environments built to han…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Systems That Scale On Command..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #4ADE80, secondary #000000, accent #10B981, background #010A04, surface #191C21, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Pixelify Sans for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Vertex - Scalable Systems For Tomorrow</title>\n\n    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n\n    <!-- Iconify -->\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <!-- GSAP -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <!-- Three.js -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r134/three.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <!-- Fonts -->\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@200;300;400;500&family=Pixelify+Sans:wght@400;500;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"antialiased bg-[#010a04] text-white min-h-screen relative overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-white/20 selection:text-white\" style=\"font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\">\n\n    <!-- Glitch WebGL Background System -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 bg-[#010a04] pointer-events-none\">\n        <!-- Base: Three.js/WebGL Canvas -->\n        <canvas id=\"bg-canvas\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none\"></canvas>\n\n        <!-- Layer 1 (Geometry): Finer Diagonal hairline grid -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-10 opacity-30 mix-blend-screen\"\n             style=\"background: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, transparent, transparent 4px, rgba(74,222,128,0.03) 4px, rgba(74,222,128,0.03) 5px);\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Layer 2 (Texture): Smaller SVG fractal noise -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-20 opacity-10 mix-blend-overlay\"\n             style=\"background-image: url('data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox=%220 0 200 200%22 xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22%3E%3Cfilter id=%22noiseFilter%22%3E%3CfeTurbulence type=%22fractalNoise%22 baseFrequency=%221.85%22 numOctaves=%223%22 stitchTiles=%22stitch%22/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width=%22100%25%22 height=%22100%25%22 filter=%22url(%23noiseFilter)%22/%3E%3C/svg%3E');\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Layer 3 (Atmosphere): Fade from deep green/black to transparent -->\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 w-full h-[60%] z-30 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#010a04] to-transparent\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Layer 4 (Readability): Multi-stop linear gradient anchor -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-40\"\n             style=\"background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(1,10,4,0.7) 0%, rgba(1,10,4,0.2) 40%, rgba(1,10,4,0.95) 100%);\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Architectural Container Lines -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-10 pointer-events-none flex justify-center w-full h-full opacity-60\">\n        <div class=\"w-full max-w-7xl h-full relative\">\n            <!-- Framed Grid L-Brackets -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-8 left-0 w-4 h-4 border-t border-l border-white/20\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute top-8 right-0 w-4 h-4 border-t border-r border-white/20\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-8 left-0 w-4 h-4 border-b border-l border-white/20\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-8 right-0 w-4 h-4 border-b border-r border-white/20\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Left Line & Nodes -->\n            <div class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-px bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-white/[0.05] to-transparent\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute top-[20%] left-[-2px] w-1.5 h-1.5 border border-white/10 bg-black\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute top-[80%] left-[-2px] w-1.5 h-1.5 border border-white/10 bg-black\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Right Line & Nodes -->\n            <div class=\"absolute right-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-px bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-white/[0.05] to-transparent\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute top-[30%] right-[-2px] w-1.5 h-1.5 border border-white/10 bg-black\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute top-[70%] right-[-2px] w-1.5 h-1.5 border border-white/10 bg-black\"></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Main Shell Container -->\n    <div class=\"relative z-20 flex flex-col min-h-screen w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto\">\n\n        <!-- Header -->\n        <header class=\"w-full px-6 py-8 flex justify-between items-center text-sm font-light\">\n            <!-- Logo -->\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 drop-shadow-[0_2px_4px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)]\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:layers-linear\" class=\"text-2xl text-white\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                <span class=\"text-xl tracking-tight\" style=\"font-family: 'Pixelify Sans', sans-serif;\">Vertex</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Navigation -->\n            <nav class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-10 text-white/60\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300\">Solutions</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300\">Framework</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300\">Company</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300\">Reach Out</a>\n            </nav>\n\n            <!-- Header CTA -->\n            <div class=\"relative inline-flex rounded-full p-px bg-gradient-to-b from-white/20 to-white/5 shadow-[0px_2px_3px_-1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1),0px_1px_0px_0px_rgba(25,28,33,0.02),0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(25,28,33,0.08)]\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-2 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-b from-[#1a1a1a] to-black text-white/80 hover:text-white transition-all duration-300 backdrop-blur-md shadow-[inset_0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.1),inset_0_-1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.02),0_2px_4px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)]\">\n                    Activate Core\n                </a>\n            </div>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- Hero Section -->\n        <main id=\"hero\" class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col items-center justify-center px-4 pt-10 pb-32 text-center\">\n\n            <!-- Eyebrow -->\n            <div class=\"overflow-hidden mb-8\">\n                <div class=\"hero-reveal text-xs text-white/50 tracking-wide font-light uppercase\">\n                    Built for resilience. Tuned for performance.\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Headline -->\n            <h1 class=\"text-4xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl lg:text-8xl leading-tight tracking-tighter font-light mb-8 max-w-5xl flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1 sm:gap-y-2\">\n                <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-block\"><span class=\"hero-reveal inline-block pb-2\">Systems</span></span>\n                <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-block\"><span class=\"hero-reveal inline-block pb-2\">That</span></span>\n                <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-block\"><span class=\"hero-reveal inline-block pb-2\">Scale</span></span>\n                <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-block\"><span class=\"hero-reveal inline-block pb-2\">On</span></span>\n                <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-block\">\n                    <span class=\"hero-reveal inline-block text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-[#bef264] via-[#4ade80] to-[#10b981] pb-2 pr-3 drop-shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(74,222,128,0.2)]\" style=\"font-family: 'Pixelify Sans', sans-serif;\">Command.</span>\n                </span>\n            </h1>\n\n            <!-- Subheadline -->\n            <p class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-white/60 max-w-2xl mb-12 flex flex-col items-center gap-1 font-extralight leading-relaxed\">\n                <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-block\"><span class=\"hero-reveal inline-block\">We construct robust, distributed architectures and dynamic environments</span></span>\n                <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-block\"><span class=\"hero-reveal inline-block\">built to handle massive throughput and supercharge global delivery.</span></span>\n            </p>\n\n            <!-- CTAs -->\n            <div class=\"overflow-hidden mt-4\">\n                <div class=\"hero-reveal flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-6 sm:gap-8\">\n\n                    <div class=\"relative inline-flex p-px rounded-full bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-[#d4d4d4] shadow-[0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_1px_1px_-0.5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_3px_3px_-1.5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),_0px_6px_6px_-3px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_12px_12px_-6px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_24px_24px_-12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06)] transform hover:scale-[1.02] active:scale-[0.98] transition-all duration-300\">\n                        <button class=\"bg-gradient-to-b from-[#ffffff] to-[#e5e5e5] text-black px-7 py-3.5 rounded-full text-sm font-medium shadow-[inset_0_2px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,1),inset_0_-1px_2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.15),0_1px_2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.8);\">\n                            Explore Deployment\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"group flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-white/80 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300 drop-shadow-[0_1px_2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8)]\">\n                        Discover Framework\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-lg group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform duration-300\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </a>\n\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </main>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Scripts -->\n    <script>\n        // --- GSAP Masked Reveal Animation ---\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            gsap.set(\".hero-reveal\", { y: \"120%\" });\n            gsap.to(\".hero-reveal\", {\n                y: \"0%\",\n                duration: 1.2,\n                ease: \"power4.out\",\n                stagger: 0.08,\n                delay: 0.2\n            });\n        });\n\n        // --- Three.js Greenish Glitch WebGL System ---\n        const canvas = document.getElementById('bg-canvas');\n        const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({\n            canvas,\n            alpha: true,\n            antialias: false\n        });\n\n        // Clamp DPR for performance\n        renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n        renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n\n        // Orthographic camera mapping directly to Normalized Device Coordinates\n        const camera = new THREE.OrthographicCamera(-1, 1, 1, -1, 0, 1);\n        const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n        const geometry = new THREE.PlaneGeometry(2, 2);\n\n        const material = new THREE.ShaderMaterial({\n            uniforms: {\n                u_time: { value: 0.0 },\n                u_resolution: { value: new THREE.Vector2(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight) },\n                u_interactive_fidelity: { value: 0.5 }\n            },\n            vertexShader: `\n                varying vec2 vUv;\n                void main() {\n                    vUv = uv;\n                    gl_Position = vec4(position, 1.0);\n                }\n            `,\n            fragmentShader: `\n                uniform float u_time;\n                uniform vec2 u_resolution;\n                uniform float u_interactive_fidelity;\n                varying vec2 vUv;\n\n                // Pseudo-random noise function\n                float rand(vec2 n) {\n                    return fract(sin(dot(n, vec2(12.9898, 4.1414))) * 43758.5453);\n                }\n\n                void main() {\n                    vec2 p = vUv * 2.0 - 1.0;\n                    p.x *= u_resolution.x / u_resolution.y;\n\n                    float t = u_time * 1.5;\n                    float glitchAmount = 0.0;\n\n                    // Horizontal glitch tearing - Finer frequency, lower amplitude\n                    if(rand(vec2(t, floor(p.y * 36.0))) > 0.96) {\n                        glitchAmount += 0.05 * sin(t * 10.0);\n                    }\n                    if(rand(vec2(t * 0.5, floor(p.y * 75.0))) > 0.98) {\n                        glitchAmount -= 0.03 * cos(t * 20.0);\n                    }\n\n                    vec2 gp = p;\n                    gp.x += glitchAmount;\n\n                    // Rotation for diagonal wave effect\n                    float a = 0.55;\n                    mat2 rot = mat2(cos(a), -sin(a), sin(a), cos(a));\n                    gp = rot * gp;\n\n                    vec3 color = vec3(0.0);\n                    float spread = 0.06 * (0.3 + u_interactive_fidelity * 0.7);\n\n                    for(int i = 0; i < 3; i++) {\n                        float offset = float(1 - i) * spread;\n                        float y = gp.y + offset + (sin(gp.x * 2.5 - u_time * 1.0) * 0.12);\n                        float wave = smoothstep(0.85, 0.99, sin(y * 6.0 + u_time * 1.5) * 0.5 + 0.5);\n\n                        // Greenish color palette\n                        if(i == 0) color.r += wave * 0.15;\n                        if(i == 1) color.g += wave * 0.95;\n                        if(i == 2) color.b += wave * 0.35;\n                    }\n\n                    // Pixel block artifacts - Finer grid\n                    float blockNoise = rand(floor(vUv * 150.0) + floor(u_time * 12.0));\n                    if (blockNoise > 0.98) {\n                        color.g += 0.15;\n                        color.b += 0.05;\n                    }\n\n                    gl_FragColor = vec4(color, 1.0);\n                }\n            `\n        });\n\n        const mesh = new THREE.Mesh(geometry, material);\n        scene.add(mesh);\n\n        // Resize handler\n        window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n            renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n            material.uniforms.u_resolution.value.set(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n        });\n\n        // Animation loop\n        const clock = new THREE.Clock();\n        function animate() {\n            requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n            material.uniforms.u_time.value = clock.getElapsedTime();\n            renderer.render(scene, camera);\n        }\n        animate();\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "vertex-scalable-systems-for-tomorrow-1.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/vertex-scalable-systems-for-tomorrow-1.jpg", "source_name": "vertex-scalable-systems-for-tomorrow-1-DESIGN.md", "views": 287, "forks": 14, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T23:46:16.666937+00:00"}